  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Espacios de Desarrollo Cultural en El Salvador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In collaboration with community organizations Museo de la Palabra y la Imagen (MUPI) will bring rural areas exhibits and film forums on migration women&apos;s issues environmental concerns and other topics and will train residents to manage exhibits and develop materials for them. It will evaluate the impact of migration-related programming on the likelihood of young adults migrating and will collaborate with diaspora organizations on cultural events in the U.S. The work will benefit 3600 rural Salvadorans directly 10000 indirectly and should strengthen MUPI as an institution. ....</narrative>
  </description>
